  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Thermal-plex: fluidic-free, rapid sequential multiplexed imaging with DNA-encoded thermal channels (2023) in Zenodo. 30 download(s) recorded.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Thermal-plex: fluidic-free, rapid sequential multiplexed imaging with DNA-encoded thermal channels (2023) in Zenodo is authored by Hong, Fan, Kishi, Jocelyn and Delgado, Ryan. Topics: Multiplexing, Buffer (optical fiber), Fluorescence, Fluorescence-lifetime imaging microscopy and Channel (broadcasting).</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">No citations yet.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Limited online visibility beyond citations.</p>",
